{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:0.4"], "en": "7. The Gūthapāṇa Jātaka “A hero,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:1.1", "PA_ja_227:1.2"], "en": "having encountered another hero who strikes with great prowess;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:1.3"], "en": "\"Come, Nāga, turn back!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:1.4"], "en": "Why do you flee in fear?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:1.5"], "en": "Let the people of Aṅga and Magadha see!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:1.6"], "en": "“Your prowess and mine.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:2.1"], "en": "“I shall not kill you with my feet,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:2.2"], "en": "nor with my tusks, nor with my trunk;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:2.3"], "en": "“I shall slay him with filth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_227:2.4"], "en": "let the putrid one be slain by the putrid.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
